                            "In the initial implementation this should be directly derived <macro_em>from</macro_em> tool hints. In future implementations this will be a database holding user preferences. It's important that this is a trait because we will likely want different permission behavior between the interactive streaming chat interface and other AI surfaces like memory, automations, and the MCP server."
